.TH ferry-config-repair 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-config\-repair \- Repair a damaged configuration file: what can be read is kept, a copy of the old file is saved next to it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry config repair\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Repair a damaged configuration file: what can be read is kept, a copy of the old file is saved next to it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Repair without asking
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
